   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "35": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">用 /branch 管理上下文</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "36": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">整个会话就像一棵树，branch 是在任意 turn 标记一个检查点，可以从这些检查点 resume</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "37": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">每个对话尽量只干一件相同研究方向的事，让上下文干净一些~</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "38": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">发现某个 turn 的尝试比较失败，可以用 /rewind 或者连续按两下 Esc 来回退</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "39": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">在动手前对齐尽可能多的细节</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "40": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">cc 老师在遇到不确定的细节时，会自以为是地以它的意思来写，并且会静默、不汇报</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "41": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">在动手前把所有细节讲解出来，与我们对齐</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "42": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">搭建 cc 自己提交任务的 pipeline</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "43": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">这样 AI 在任务初期可以有 smoke test 以及频繁的 debug 流程</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "44": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">尽量提出具体、确切的 goal</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "45": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">例如一个可以对着一个可验证的 ground truth 自我验证的任务</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "46": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">可以让它起一个 subagent 作为验证者，来评判是否达成目标，若未达成能不断重启</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "47": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">可以先用其他论文搜索工具/网站把相关文献检索好</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "48": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">多篇论文阅读的 context 是较长的，可以尝试将其用 subagent 实现，使上下文干净~</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "49": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">如果有可能，可以反复地检查代码、论文细节</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "50": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">即使是简单的重复prompt、重复检查，push 它从各种角度检查也能发现新东西</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "51": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">在 prompt 中可以表达 “不怕困难” 这样的意思，让它持续探索、不退化</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "52": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">养成 git diff 的情况，有不明白的地方要及时问它</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "53": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">它的总结总是很漂亮的，但是可能和实际改动对不上，特别是一些小细节</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "54": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">养成看 </span><span class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\"><span class=\"inline-code inline-code_start inline-code_end\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span data-string=\"true\">git diff</span></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\"> 的习惯，阅读真实代码，以真实 diff 为准</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "55": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">可以开多个 branch 来向它提问某个你不理解的、关键的 section</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "56": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">及时 commit~</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "57": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">对 wandb 中的数据，要先人看</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "58": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">实验中 wandb 所体现的现象，可以人先指出 xx指标出现了xx</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "59": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">它直接读 wandb 保存的数据可能需要长时间的搜索，并且可能污染上下文</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "60": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">对于实验的log（几千行），可以新开 branch 给它，它会细致地查找、定位</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "61": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">打通自动化科研需要</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "62": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">自动放实验、停实验、调整配置（用于监控昂贵的训练过程）</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "63": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">完成之后会有消息提示（在cc中可以配置hook）</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "64": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">一些其他的小技巧~</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading3"
  },
  "65": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\">学会使用每个项目下的</span><span class=\" author-7342907534354694172\" data-leaf=\"true\"><span class=\"inline-code inline-code_start inline-code_end\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span data-string=\"true\">CLAUDE.md</span></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
